## Notes on Arguments and Attributes

- `environment_id`: Changing it forces a new resource.
- `namespace`: Changing it forces a new resource.
- `name`: Changing it forces a new resource.

## Import

Gateways can be imported with `<environment_id>:<namespace>:<name>`; every argument is read back from the cluster:

```shell
terraform import portainer_kubernetes_gateway.edge 4:web:edge
```
